I've started playing as a Priest for the first time.  In my last game
I found a blessed magic lamp on level 2, which produced a wish-
granting genie when rubbed.  I was about to wish for the usual dragon
scale mail, when I remembered this snippet from the Nethack wiki:

"The slotless magic resistance and toggleable conflict make the
Sceptre a great wish for lawful non-Cavemen, especially in the early
game."

I thought "I'm a lawful non-Caveman, and it's the very early game!
That would be awesome!"  So I wished for the Sceptre, and it promptly
blasted my still-1st-level, 14-hit-point ass into oblivion.  Sigh.


